      en: ["Wall length: 2.1 km.", "Number of bastions: 15.", "Maximum height: 6 m.", "Wall thickness: 1.2–1.5 m.", "Construction period: 14th to 17th century.", "Part of a UNESCO World Heritage site (1996)."],
